      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not established",
      "items": [
        "G1: fused claims arm 0.129 against a 0.64 bar — worse than prose alone (−0.154, CI95 upper −0.065)",
        "Mechanism: equal-weight RRF over a ~127-session claims list displaces prose rank-1/2 gold (12 of 17 lost)",
        "G2 entailment: one auditor scored identical items 82 → 16 → 86; families 14–21 points apart — not measurable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What held",
      "items": [
        "0 unbound writes over 2,057 citations across two writer versions and 384 runs",
        "Claims carry relational signal (R 0.207 vs 0.103) and none for paraphrase",
